(567554, 57479, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m confused as to how this is considered Garage Art.  In my opinion, that would be art...created in the garage.  This doesn''t appear to be anything that would normally be found in the garage (I hope) and it doesn''t appear to be IN a garage.  The shot is cute...sure, but just not right for this challenge.<br/>As for the photo itself (trying to be helpful here) I think the face of the boy is too blurry, needs more focus, and I don''t like the shadow on the boys face.<br/></td>', 'I guess I''m confused as to how this is considered Garage Art.  In my opinion, that would be art...created in the garage.  This doesn''t appear to be anything that would normally be found in the garage (I hope) and it doesn''t appear to be IN a garage.  The shot is cute...sure, but just not right for this challenge.As for the photo itself (trying to be helpful here) I think the face of the boy is too blurry, needs more focus, and I don''t like the shadow on the boys face.', '2004-02-04 00:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567556, 58359, 16266, '<td valign="top">welllll.............. garage..................... i got a BAD rating on my last challenge for not following the directions close enough..... but... well.... i laughed outloud... this was a great funny image.  perhaps you could crop a little of the right.  saturation, color, and contrast look good.... funny funny.... i''ll give you a 9 ..</td>', 'welllll.............. garage..................... i got a BAD rating on my last challenge for not following the directions close enough..... but... well.... i laughed outloud... this was a great funny image.  perhaps you could crop a little of the right.  saturation, color, and contrast look good.... funny funny.... i''ll give you a 9 ..', '2004-02-04 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(567558, 58359, 772, '<td valign="top">cant find much of a tie-in to the challenge on this photo...</td>', 'cant find much of a tie-in to the challenge on this photo...', '2004-02-04 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(567559, 58519, 12712, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but is the hammer being struck(or so that is what it appears to be diong) intential?  Because it looks a little odd.</td>', 'Nice idea, but is the hammer being struck(or so that is what it appears to be diong) intential?  Because it looks a little odd.', '2004-02-04 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(567563, 58359, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo, but unfortunately has nothing to do with the challenge.  Piece of advice...Don''t be afraid to sit out for a challenge.  Better to sit out then to be scored low for a good pic just cause it has absolutely nothing to do with the topic we''re suposed to be shooting for.<br/>As for the photo...it''s nice.  Great focus and lighting.  I like that the fence is behind him a nd not in front of him.  The expression is priceless...but honestly, for this challenge, I have to score it low. Sorry.</td>', 'It''s a good photo, but unfortunately has nothing to do with the challenge.  Piece of advice...Don''t be afraid to sit out for a challenge.  Better to sit out then to be scored low for a good pic just cause it has absolutely nothing to do with the topic we''re suposed to be shooting for.As for the photo...it''s nice.  Great focus and lighting.  I like that the fence is behind him a nd not in front of him.  The expression is priceless...but honestly, for this challenge, I have to score it low. Sorry.', '2004-02-04 00:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
