(567820, 58522, 16266, '<td valign="top">I feel the cropping in this image is too tight.  space around the tools would be effective, or perhaps the opposite, more extreme cropping, but just snipping cropping is rarely effective.  Perhaps a little dark.  The image also seems very weighted to the right side.  There isnothing leading or contrasting the empty space on the left.  If even one wrench was stretching over there a bit more it would help.</td>', 'I feel the cropping in this image is too tight.  space around the tools would be effective, or perhaps the opposite, more extreme cropping, but just snipping cropping is rarely effective.  Perhaps a little dark.  The image also seems very weighted to the right side.  There isnothing leading or contrasting the empty space on the left.  If even one wrench was stretching over there a bit more it would help.', '2004-02-04 01:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
