(567889, 58490, 16623, '<td valign="top">As far as the picture goes, I think it is great. You did a great job with lighting and composition. HOWEVER, I don''t think that it captures the theme of "garage art" - even though that is where you keep this lovely chess board.</td>', 'As far as the picture goes, I think it is great. You did a great job with lighting and composition. HOWEVER, I don''t think that it captures the theme of "garage art" - even though that is where you keep this lovely chess board.', '2004-02-04 02:55:32.000000', NULL, 1);
