(567890, 58479, 16623, '<td valign="top">If these wrenches are on a white surface, then you need to learn to shoot white, even when your meter is telling you 18%grey. On my screen this is reading an off grey. - for commerial work this isn''t a bad thing, but considering what you titled your print, it is.</td>', 'If these wrenches are on a white surface, then you need to learn to shoot white, even when your meter is telling you 18%grey. On my screen this is reading an off grey. - for commerial work this isn''t a bad thing, but considering what you titled your print, it is.', '2004-02-04 02:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
