(567936, 57937, 14499, '<td valign="top">Ohhh an Ozzie ! It''s nice to see something familiar that you can understand :)) you could have picked the SH*T up of the floor though! it would have been a hell of a lot better. Hmmm not an 8 either -10 points ;) If it has turbo I will give them back ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-11 00:31:24.</i></td>', 'Ohhh an Ozzie ! It''s nice to see something familiar that you can understand :)) you could have picked the SH*T up of the floor though! it would have been a hell of a lot better. Hmmm not an 8 either -10 points ;) If it has turbo I will give them back ;)', '2004-02-04 05:29:27.000000', '2004-02-11 00:31:24.000000', 1),
