(567963, 58502, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but too much color saturation IMHO. <br/>I would like to see this in B/W.</td>', 'Good idea, but too much color saturation IMHO. I would like to see this in B/W.', '2004-02-04 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
