(567967, 58131, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. One of the best around. I am sure I will see it again in top 10 or in top 3. It is a 10 from me and congratulations.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. One of the best around. I am sure I will see it again in top 10 or in top 3. It is a 10 from me and congratulations.', '2004-02-04 05:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
