(567969, 57675, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Gardening it is a passion of mine too. But I give this photo a 10 just because it is so wonderful as a photo. I just love the soft  lights on the flowers. The shadows are not harsh but soft also. Just perfect.</td>', 'Excellent. Gardening it is a passion of mine too. But I give this photo a 10 just because it is so wonderful as a photo. I just love the soft  lights on the flowers. The shadows are not harsh but soft also. Just perfect.', '2004-02-04 06:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(567970, 58381, 8139, '<td valign="top">This is a WOW. Love black on black, textures, simplicity of composition...<br/>I''m not sure this meets totally the challenge theme, but what a photo !</td>', 'This is a WOW. Love black on black, textures, simplicity of composition...I''m not sure this meets totally the challenge theme, but what a photo !', '2004-02-04 06:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(567972, 57687, 12902, '<td valign="top">One of the best around. Top 10. Sometimes a spark is just enough to reach one''s goal. 10</td>', 'One of the best around. Top 10. Sometimes a spark is just enough to reach one''s goal. 10', '2004-02-04 06:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(567973, 57819, 7252, '<td valign="top">I could never quite understand why poms and other commonwealthers call these spanners. I like the silhouettes though. A few bits of dirt and rough edges need to be cleaned up but otherwise a strong image.</td>', 'I could never quite understand why poms and other commonwealthers call these spanners. I like the silhouettes though. A few bits of dirt and rough edges need to be cleaned up but otherwise a strong image.', '2004-02-04 06:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(567974, 57715, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and idea. Not sure the shadow is necessary.<br/>Is the tittle in Flemish or Dutch dialect ?</td>', 'Nice composition and idea. Not sure the shadow is necessary.Is the tittle in Flemish or Dutch dialect ?', '2004-02-04 06:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(567975, 58373, 4906, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour scheme that you chose for the garage!<br/>Not too keen on the blown out background or the shallow DOF on the brushes.</td>', 'Interesting colour scheme that you chose for the garage!Not too keen on the blown out background or the shallow DOF on the brushes.', '2004-02-04 06:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(567976, 57708, 4906, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more light on the top/front of the can. Nice subject though.</td>', 'Needs a bit more light on the top/front of the can. Nice subject though.', '2004-02-04 06:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(567977, 57675, 7252, '<td valign="top">Needs a couple of reflectors to help balance out the light. One on the right and one to the front.</td>', 'Needs a couple of reflectors to help balance out the light. One on the right and one to the front.', '2004-02-04 06:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567978, 57877, 6130, '<td valign="top">A fantastic combination of vintage and garbage.10</td>', 'A fantastic combination of vintage and garbage.10', '2004-02-04 06:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(567979, 58539, 6130, '<td valign="top">Simple and very good.</td>', 'Simple and very good.', '2004-02-04 06:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(567980, 58472, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice title.</td>', 'Nice title.', '2004-02-04 06:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(567982, 58329, 7252, '<td valign="top">With a much larger piece of white paper this would be much better.</td>', 'With a much larger piece of white paper this would be much better.', '2004-02-04 06:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(567983, 57945, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is not a Garage Art! It´s a garage itself!</td>', 'This is not a Garage Art! It´s a garage itself!', '2004-02-04 06:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(567984, 58523, 7252, '<td valign="top">So far this is my highest rated photo in this challenge. B&amp;W was a great choice. Good sharpness and great action. Composition is very good.</td>', 'So far this is my highest rated photo in this challenge. B&W was a great choice. Good sharpness and great action. Composition is very good.', '2004-02-04 06:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567985, 58523, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very good shot and subject. It´s a tipical garage stuff. Very well done reflections and motion. You got my best regards.</td>', 'Very good shot and subject. It´s a tipical garage stuff. Very well done reflections and motion. You got my best regards.', '2004-02-04 06:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567986, 57471, 7252, '<td valign="top">Might be slightly more interesting on the diagonal.</td>', 'Might be slightly more interesting on the diagonal.', '2004-02-04 06:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567987, 57479, 13759, '<td valign="top">I´m trying to understand what it can be related with garages.</td>', 'I´m trying to understand what it can be related with garages.', '2004-02-04 06:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567988, 57476, 4906, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred this with a plainer/lighter background.</td>', 'I''d have preferred this with a plainer/lighter background.', '2004-02-04 06:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567989, 58381, 13759, '<td valign="top">I´m trying to understand how it can be related with garages. A hat... typically used in the field? Well, I cant´t understand.</td>', 'I´m trying to understand how it can be related with garages. A hat... typically used in the field? Well, I cant´t understand.', '2004-02-04 06:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(567990, 57471, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful shot! Nice colors.</td>', 'Very wonderful shot! Nice colors.', '2004-02-04 06:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567991, 58131, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-02-04 06:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(567992, 58467, 7252, '<td valign="top">Very much too dark.</td>', 'Very much too dark.', '2004-02-04 06:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(567993, 58523, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, focus and good feeling of motion. One of my favourites this week.</td>', 'Nice composition, focus and good feeling of motion. One of my favourites this week.', '2004-02-04 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(567994, 58391, 13759, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like this. The photography can be improved with a near shoot. May be an 45 degree angle help to eliminate the fhasl reflections and overexposed areas. To distribute light equally, a white paper sheet in front of you in a straight angle can be used as reflector and difuser. But I like so much of your idea.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like this. The photography can be improved with a near shoot. May be an 45 degree angle help to eliminate the fhasl reflections and overexposed areas. To distribute light equally, a white paper sheet in front of you in a straight angle can be used as reflector and difuser. But I like so much of your idea.', '2004-02-04 06:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(567995, 58416, 4906, '<td valign="top">Very good image.</td>', 'Very good image.', '2004-02-04 06:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(567996, 57673, 7732, '<td valign="top">Mér fannst fyrri hugmyndin þín betri.</td>', 'Mér fannst fyrri hugmyndin þín betri.', '2004-02-04 06:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(567997, 57937, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great Idea! Very original.</td>', 'Great Idea! Very original.', '2004-02-04 06:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(567998, 58411, 4906, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. Nice effect.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. Nice effect.', '2004-02-04 06:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(567999, 58418, 7252, '<td valign="top">We all do... what? I have no idea what is going on in this photo.</td>', 'We all do... what? I have no idea what is going on in this photo.', '2004-02-04 06:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568000, 58131, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s very interesting and has a great composition. It´s art!! While wondering, it are a bit unsharped. May be you had unsharpened it. I prefer more sharp. But it´s only my opinion.</td>', 'It´s very interesting and has a great composition. It´s art!! While wondering, it are a bit unsharped. May be you had unsharpened it. I prefer more sharp. But it´s only my opinion.', '2004-02-04 06:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(568001, 57897, 4906, '<td valign="top">A closer crop on the subject would have worked better for me.</td>', 'A closer crop on the subject would have worked better for me.', '2004-02-04 06:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(568002, 58359, 7252, '<td valign="top">While a fine and detailed photo of this animal I don''t think one would normally find this in a garage.</td>', 'While a fine and detailed photo of this animal I don''t think one would normally find this in a garage.', '2004-02-04 06:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(568003, 58131, 12514, '<td valign="top">A little to dark</td>', 'A little to dark', '2004-02-04 06:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(568004, 57851, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great idea! You do a great artwork here. The photography itself has a very confuse look. I need to pay many attention to try to catch your intentions here. The idea itself as I said is very well. By this confuse composition, no.</td>', 'Great idea! You do a great artwork here. The photography itself has a very confuse look. I need to pay many attention to try to catch your intentions here. The idea itself as I said is very well. By this confuse composition, no.', '2004-02-04 06:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(568005, 57819, 4906, '<td valign="top">Background should be more white.</td>', 'Background should be more white.', '2004-02-04 06:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(568006, 58490, 13759, '<td valign="top">Well, I doubt you has an old chessborad in your garage! :) But chessborads is not a typical garage stuff, then this not meet the challenge. Sorry :(</td>', 'Well, I doubt you has an old chessborad in your garage! :) But chessborads is not a typical garage stuff, then this not meet the challenge. Sorry :(', '2004-02-04 07:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(568007, 58484, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s your garage? Nice to meet. But what about art?</td>', 'It´s your garage? Nice to meet. But what about art?', '2004-02-04 07:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(568008, 58103, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good shoot!</td>', 'Good shoot!', '2004-02-04 07:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(568009, 58513, 13759, '<td valign="top">You has a nice composition here. It´s cool. This shoot has some overexposed areas that can see left and right below. The screw drivers in the top has some reflections that run out of your control and turn to overexposed to. This kind of shoot needs intense light control. Sometimes you need a reflector (a white paper sheet can be used) and a strong light. Then you control the exposure get it e darker as you want, but with reflected ligth the glares are dimmed and you had a difuse light that cover a wider area with smother tones.</td>', 'You has a nice composition here. It´s cool. This shoot has some overexposed areas that can see left and right below. The screw drivers in the top has some reflections that run out of your control and turn to overexposed to. This kind of shoot needs intense light control. Sometimes you need a reflector (a white paper sheet can be used) and a strong light. Then you control the exposure get it e darker as you want, but with reflected ligth the glares are dimmed and you had a difuse light that cover a wider area with smother tones.', '2004-02-04 07:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(568011, 58216, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very original! Wonderful artwork. I like almost all in this. The star light in green socket is very nice. In the yellow you break a bit the scene by the reflections of your light source but a great job.</td>', 'Very original! Wonderful artwork. I like almost all in this. The star light in green socket is very nice. In the yellow you break a bit the scene by the reflections of your light source but a great job.', '2004-02-04 07:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568015, 58420, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wine storage... in some cases may exists in garages.</td>', 'Wine storage... in some cases may exists in garages.', '2004-02-04 07:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(568017, 57911, 14453, '<td valign="top">Quality of the picture: Excellent.  Quality of the subject?  Euh.......!!  It''s a 9 to me.</td>', 'Quality of the picture: Excellent.  Quality of the subject?  Euh.......!!  It''s a 9 to me.', '2004-02-04 07:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(568019, 58023, 13759, '<td valign="top">Really I had only one word about it: Focus. It´s a good composition, the clock is disposable, but the three wrenchs are in good form to make a big shoot. A tip, is to try some points of view, and explore your light conditions. If the light is not good, your camera can´t do a great focus job, then try to use a tripod and manual focus.</td>', 'Really I had only one word about it: Focus. It´s a good composition, the clock is disposable, but the three wrenchs are in good form to make a big shoot. A tip, is to try some points of view, and explore your light conditions. If the light is not good, your camera can´t do a great focus job, then try to use a tripod and manual focus.', '2004-02-04 07:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568021, 58038, 13759, '<td valign="top">Big shoot. Very funny and well done.</td>', 'Big shoot. Very funny and well done.', '2004-02-04 07:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(568022, 58133, 13759, '<td valign="top">You had this in the garage?</td>', 'You had this in the garage?', '2004-02-04 07:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(568026, 58359, 13759, '<td valign="top">Incredible! Very well done job. This was stunning. Unfortunately I can´t vote it high because this challenge requires some identity of the stuff, used to produce the artwork, with garages. Certainly a sheep is not a commom thing to put in garage. Then this don´t meet the challenge. This break my heart, but I need to do it.</td>', 'Incredible! Very well done job. This was stunning. Unfortunately I can´t vote it high because this challenge requires some identity of the stuff, used to produce the artwork, with garages. Certainly a sheep is not a commom thing to put in garage. Then this don´t meet the challenge. This break my heart, but I need to do it.', '2004-02-04 07:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(568027, 57532, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great job!</td>', 'Wow! Great job!', '2004-02-04 07:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
