(568695, 58047, 10047, '<td valign="top">Is that a Mazda 626? Its hard to tell with the photo stretched. If so, I hope it has been a good car. We make those here in Flat Rock, Michigan. The backlighting is a little intense, but its nice effect on the car.</td>', 'Is that a Mazda 626? Its hard to tell with the photo stretched. If so, I hope it has been a good car. We make those here in Flat Rock, Michigan. The backlighting is a little intense, but its nice effect on the car.', '2004-02-04 14:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(568696, 57687, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Nice effect with the spark. Maybe a little on the darkside, but maybe that was needed to make the spark standout.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Nice effect with the spark. Maybe a little on the darkside, but maybe that was needed to make the spark standout.', '2004-02-04 14:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(568697, 57609, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice background color and composition.</td>', 'Nice background color and composition.', '2004-02-04 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(568698, 58416, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with fumes coming off the iron. Would like to see a closer crop on the to the left, but still a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice effect with fumes coming off the iron. Would like to see a closer crop on the to the left, but still a nice photo.', '2004-02-04 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(568699, 57911, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W and use of shadows.</td>', 'Excellent B&W and use of shadows.', '2004-02-04 14:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(568700, 58420, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and angle. A really well done photo.</td>', 'Nice composition and angle. A really well done photo.', '2004-02-04 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(568705, 57937, 10047, '<td valign="top">Is that a Mustang? The first time I looked I thought it was, but I wasn''t sure on the 2nd look. Anyway, my plant starts building the 2005 Stang in September. Nice effect with the backlighting and the use of headlamps.</td>', 'Is that a Mustang? The first time I looked I thought it was, but I wasn''t sure on the 2nd look. Anyway, my plant starts building the 2005 Stang in September. Nice effect with the backlighting and the use of headlamps.', '2004-02-04 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(568709, 58238, 10047, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too centered and straight on. I might have tried an offset shot with some angle.</td>', 'Perhaps too centered and straight on. I might have tried an offset shot with some angle.', '2004-02-04 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(568711, 58513, 10047, '<td valign="top">There is some harsh reflection on the left and the photo has some jaggies. I might have tried shooting more from the left to get an offcenter angle shot and reduce the glare.</td>', 'There is some harsh reflection on the left and the photo has some jaggies. I might have tried shooting more from the left to get an offcenter angle shot and reduce the glare.', '2004-02-04 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(568712, 58420, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful repetitive pattern here including the reflections on the bottle. Nicely done in b/w, composition is good too.</td>', 'beautiful repetitive pattern here including the reflections on the bottle. Nicely done in b/w, composition is good too.', '2004-02-04 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(568713, 57785, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried this with a fan on low speed to try and capture the smoke swirling away. I like the effect, but the smoke seems to obscure too much. Nice color and composition.</td>', 'I might have tried this with a fan on low speed to try and capture the smoke swirling away. I like the effect, but the smoke seems to obscure too much. Nice color and composition.', '2004-02-04 15:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(568714, 57937, 13136, '<td valign="top">That garage is WAY too neat. I really like the lighting in this shot.</td>', 'That garage is WAY too neat. I really like the lighting in this shot.', '2004-02-04 15:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(568715, 58359, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great photo with good expression. Funny.</td>', 'Great photo with good expression. Funny.', '2004-02-04 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(568717, 58326, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think the background is a bit distracting.... since the challenge was to show art... the composition is important.  The can behind the interesting piece of art could have been moved to make this better.  There is not a lot of difference in the colors of the tools and workbench so color might have helped.</td>', 'I think the background is a bit distracting.... since the challenge was to show art... the composition is important.  The can behind the interesting piece of art could have been moved to make this better.  There is not a lot of difference in the colors of the tools and workbench so color might have helped.', '2004-02-04 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(568723, 58422, 10799, '<td valign="top">The contrast could be better</td>', 'The contrast could be better', '2004-02-04 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(568730, 58306, 13136, '<td valign="top">WAY too organized. (envy speaking)</td>', 'WAY too organized. (envy speaking)', '2004-02-04 15:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(568732, 57871, 13136, '<td valign="top">All right. I''ll wait until the end to see how you did this.</td>', 'All right. I''ll wait until the end to see how you did this.', '2004-02-04 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(568733, 58502, 13891, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, but the colours are over saturated for my taste.</td>', 'I really like this composition, but the colours are over saturated for my taste.', '2004-02-04 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(568736, 58215, 13136, '<td valign="top">When I saw the word ''explicit'' in your title I started looking for some hint of sex. Imagine my dissapointment to find only the word ''ArT".</td>', 'When I saw the word ''explicit'' in your title I started looking for some hint of sex. Imagine my dissapointment to find only the word ''ArT".', '2004-02-04 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568737, 58359, 13136, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. The sight of this makes me feel uneasy, like it''s a human that has turned into a sheep. Not really on topic though. In an animal shot this would be a 10.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. The sight of this makes me feel uneasy, like it''s a human that has turned into a sheep. Not really on topic though. In an animal shot this would be a 10.', '2004-02-04 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(568758, 58455, 327, '<td valign="top">This is sure different. What do I see at the bottom of the tree where it meets the roof? Your shot appears a bit over compressed and crushing your pixels a bit. Unusual tree/house I''d be worried about a storm and that coming down. Yikes. Cool find for the challenge.</td>', 'This is sure different. What do I see at the bottom of the tree where it meets the roof? Your shot appears a bit over compressed and crushing your pixels a bit. Unusual tree/house I''d be worried about a storm and that coming down. Yikes. Cool find for the challenge.', '2004-02-04 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(568759, 57608, 327, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and title. The focus and light need some improvement. I also like the composition.</td>', 'I like the idea and title. The focus and light need some improvement. I also like the composition.', '2004-02-04 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(568760, 58416, 14398, '<td valign="top">This is going to be top 10 for sure.  :) 9</td>', 'This is going to be top 10 for sure.  :) 9', '2004-02-04 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(568761, 58216, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you''d of removed the bubble wrap? It''s really causing your light to flash and bounce. That or not done this from above. Try to think more about composition.<br/>This was not a bad idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe if you''d of removed the bubble wrap? It''s really causing your light to flash and bounce. That or not done this from above. Try to think more about composition.This was not a bad idea for the challenge.', '2004-02-04 15:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(568762, 58420, 13602, '<td valign="top">Challenge is GARAGE not Garbage nice one otherways</td>', 'Challenge is GARAGE not Garbage nice one otherways', '2004-02-04 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(568763, 58391, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit lacking in excitment or pazazz. The light is hot on the first 0 and dark on the L. It needs something to make it alive or to make people want to view it more then once. Keep trying, keep shooting.</td>', 'I think this is a bit lacking in excitment or pazazz. The light is hot on the first 0 and dark on the L. It needs something to make it alive or to make people want to view it more then once. Keep trying, keep shooting.', '2004-02-04 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568764, 57624, 327, '<td valign="top">I see the simplicity you were going for in your idea. Not bad, but will need more focus (sharpen) to make this stand out. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I see the simplicity you were going for in your idea. Not bad, but will need more focus (sharpen) to make this stand out. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-04 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(568774, 58346, 13389, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color. But out of focus foreground screw distracts. The irregulariity is good, but would have preferred no screws to intersect (uniformly random).</td>', 'Great lighting and color. But out of focus foreground screw distracts. The irregulariity is good, but would have preferred no screws to intersect (uniformly random).', '2004-02-04 16:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(568778, 58346, 13886, '<td valign="top">The first screw is very distracting. Cute idea.</td>', 'The first screw is very distracting. Cute idea.', '2004-02-04 16:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(568782, 58131, 13886, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2004-02-04 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(568783, 57504, 13886, '<td valign="top">Too Dark</td>', 'Too Dark', '2004-02-04 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
