(568794, 58468, 13749, '<td valign="top">i may be completely wrong, as i don''t know what it should look like - but i''m going to use my male intuition and guess that this is a hubcap/rim for a Rolls Royce.  if you had filled the top right portion of the frame a little better (and perhaps reduced some of the reflections of objects), it might be a slightly more powerful photo.</td>', 'i may be completely wrong, as i don''t know what it should look like - but i''m going to use my male intuition and guess that this is a hubcap/rim for a Rolls Royce.  if you had filled the top right portion of the frame a little better (and perhaps reduced some of the reflections of objects), it might be a slightly more powerful photo.', '2004-02-04 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(568798, 57701, 13749, '<td valign="top">i like the derelict look here, but am not so pleased with the background being a pristine white tabletop - perhaps something else worn-down might have worked well as a backdrop here.</td>', 'i like the derelict look here, but am not so pleased with the background being a pristine white tabletop - perhaps something else worn-down might have worked well as a backdrop here.', '2004-02-04 16:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
