(568813, 58212, 13749, '<td valign="top">i like it - especially how you didn''t take the photo straight on, giving each side a slightly different depth and angle to it.  no two screws are the same (in a manner of speaking). nice work.</td>', 'i like it - especially how you didn''t take the photo straight on, giving each side a slightly different depth and angle to it.  no two screws are the same (in a manner of speaking). nice work.', '2004-02-04 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
