(568917, 57877, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, classy shot which you wouldn''t expect from garage art. :)  I like the DOF in this shot also.  The only distraction, for me anyways, is the reflection of the car outside in the glass and bottle, but it looks like you were using the natural light from the outside.  And that works nicely. Overall, very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, classy shot which you wouldn''t expect from garage art. :)  I like the DOF in this shot also.  The only distraction, for me anyways, is the reflection of the car outside in the glass and bottle, but it looks like you were using the natural light from the outside.  And that works nicely. Overall, very nice shot.', '2004-02-04 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
