(569423, 57877, 15197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition...and yet I feel llke my eye is drawn to the center where there is too much confusion.</td>', 'I like the composition...and yet I feel llke my eye is drawn to the center where there is too much confusion.', '2004-02-05 01:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(569425, 58539, 15197, '<td valign="top">Good job on the lighting and crop.</td>', 'Good job on the lighting and crop.', '2004-02-05 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569430, 58037, 15197, '<td valign="top">I love the yellows...but it just doesn''t capture the mood of orderliness for me.</td>', 'I love the yellows...but it just doesn''t capture the mood of orderliness for me.', '2004-02-05 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(569433, 58306, 15197, '<td valign="top">It is a nice snapshot and good subject, but I don''t see anything creative in the way it was taken.  Still, a good picture with clear colors.</td>', 'It is a nice snapshot and good subject, but I don''t see anything creative in the way it was taken.  Still, a good picture with clear colors.', '2004-02-05 01:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(569437, 58333, 15197, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to have it turned vertical not horizontal?  I would have liked it facing me better.  I love creative ideas...good job!</td>', 'Did you mean to have it turned vertical not horizontal?  I would have liked it facing me better.  I love creative ideas...good job!', '2004-02-05 01:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(569439, 57715, 15197, '<td valign="top">A clever composition.  Good placement, some juice coming out of the holes might have been interesting...</td>', 'A clever composition.  Good placement, some juice coming out of the holes might have been interesting...', '2004-02-05 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(569446, 58331, 15197, '<td valign="top">Good title.</td>', 'Good title.', '2004-02-05 01:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(569449, 57608, 16241, '<td valign="top">I like this, its simple and imaginative without being contrived or obvious.<br/></td>', 'I like this, its simple and imaginative without being contrived or obvious.', '2004-02-05 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(569451, 57871, 15197, '<td valign="top">You have a good imagination.</td>', 'You have a good imagination.', '2004-02-05 01:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(569454, 58000, 15197, '<td valign="top">The eye has a place to travel.  Good placement.  I like the green in the picture.</td>', 'The eye has a place to travel.  Good placement.  I like the green in the picture.', '2004-02-05 01:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(569457, 58512, 16241, '<td valign="top">manhatten skyline, very good</td>', 'manhatten skyline, very good', '2004-02-05 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(569459, 57532, 16241, '<td valign="top">like the title, good imagination</td>', 'like the title, good imagination', '2004-02-05 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(569460, 58047, 16241, '<td valign="top">appealing</td>', 'appealing', '2004-02-05 01:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569464, 58188, 16241, '<td valign="top">like this image, smartie box</td>', 'like this image, smartie box', '2004-02-05 01:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(569467, 58188, 15920, '<td valign="top">This was a little too much color for me, but, since that is what you were going tor, I guess the other comment is that the focus should have been crisp on everything.</td>', 'This was a little too much color for me, but, since that is what you were going tor, I guess the other comment is that the focus should have been crisp on everything.', '2004-02-05 01:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(569471, 58004, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is quite good composition - simple repetitive pattern with great colors and then the non-uniformity of the rope.  I hope you do very well.</td>', 'This is quite good composition - simple repetitive pattern with great colors and then the non-uniformity of the rope.  I hope you do very well.', '2004-02-05 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(569475, 57911, 15920, '<td valign="top">You might get killed in the voting (my wife is looking over my shoulder "suggesting" a "1") but, I think there is good composition with repetive patterns, decent organization, etc.)  I might have moved the empty outlier up with the others, and the screw drivers would have looked better in a parrallel pattern, but all in very good compostion.  The lighting is great.  I hope you do well.</td>', 'You might get killed in the voting (my wife is looking over my shoulder "suggesting" a "1") but, I think there is good composition with repetive patterns, decent organization, etc.)  I might have moved the empty outlier up with the others, and the screw drivers would have looked better in a parrallel pattern, but all in very good compostion.  The lighting is great.  I hope you do well.', '2004-02-05 01:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(569478, 58512, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Might have made the two subjects closer in size as I needed to look at the title and think a little to understand this shot.</td>', 'Great idea.  Might have made the two subjects closer in size as I needed to look at the title and think a little to understand this shot.', '2004-02-05 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(569482, 58333, 15920, '<td valign="top">The focus might be a little off, but, I couldn''t stop laughing long enough to tell for sure.  Nice job.</td>', 'The focus might be a little off, but, I couldn''t stop laughing long enough to tell for sure.  Nice job.', '2004-02-05 02:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(569483, 57715, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this challenge. Perfect.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this challenge. Perfect.', '2004-02-05 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(569484, 57911, 2279, '<td valign="top">One of my tops for the week.</td>', 'One of my tops for the week.', '2004-02-05 02:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(569491, 58411, 6948, '<td valign="top">Very good pic but I think that it''s not sutable for this contest</td>', 'Very good pic but I think that it''s not sutable for this contest', '2004-02-05 03:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(569494, 57479, 16493, '<td valign="top">Garage art?</td>', 'Garage art?', '2004-02-05 03:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(569496, 57487, 16493, '<td valign="top">Garage art?</td>', 'Garage art?', '2004-02-05 03:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(569499, 57871, 16493, '<td valign="top">How? Did you get it out again?</td>', 'How? Did you get it out again?', '2004-02-05 03:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(569508, 57964, 16493, '<td valign="top">its more like an ad then art</td>', 'its more like an ad then art', '2004-02-05 04:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(569510, 58215, 11181, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly... i love this pic!</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly... i love this pic!', '2004-02-05 04:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(569511, 58495, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t find this a very interesting image. Perhaps if you had photographed it from a different point of view (maybe lower), and included more of the clutter you would have got your point over a bit better.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t find this a very interesting image. Perhaps if you had photographed it from a different point of view (maybe lower), and included more of the clutter you would have got your point over a bit better.', '2004-02-05 04:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(569512, 58306, 11181, '<td valign="top">Wish my garage was this neat! - 8</td>', 'Wish my garage was this neat! - 8', '2004-02-05 04:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(569513, 57397, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you have had, but I think it might have been more effective without the car. I would have also liked to have seen the right-hand side of the door-way, just to frame the figure.</td>', 'I like the idea you have had, but I think it might have been more effective without the car. I would have also liked to have seen the right-hand side of the door-way, just to frame the figure.', '2004-02-05 04:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(569514, 57562, 11181, '<td valign="top">Nice pic! A little too bright on the flash though - 8</td>', 'Nice pic! A little too bright on the flash though - 8', '2004-02-05 04:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(569515, 58457, 5364, '<td valign="top">This has lot of potential, but I think the lighting is a bit bland. If it were strongly side or bottom lit, it would look quite menacing!</td>', 'This has lot of potential, but I think the lighting is a bit bland. If it were strongly side or bottom lit, it would look quite menacing!', '2004-02-05 04:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(569520, 58487, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good simple image, but it needs more contrast to make the background black.</td>', 'It''s a good simple image, but it needs more contrast to make the background black.', '2004-02-05 04:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(569522, 58359, 5364, '<td valign="top">An excellent quality photo, but it why enter it in this challenge?</td>', 'An excellent quality photo, but it why enter it in this challenge?', '2004-02-05 04:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(569525, 57928, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, it''s a good subject for a abstract photo, but there appears to be motion-blur, which has made things a but fuzzy. You could also increase the contrast a bit, as it is a bit grey.</td>', 'I like the idea, it''s a good subject for a abstract photo, but there appears to be motion-blur, which has made things a but fuzzy. You could also increase the contrast a bit, as it is a bit grey.', '2004-02-05 05:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(569543, 58131, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, but the small sockets on the right are disappearing into the background. An alternative colour backround might have helped, or you might have got a better reflection from the bootom face of those sockets.</td>', 'This is nicely done, but the small sockets on the right are disappearing into the background. An alternative colour backround might have helped, or you might have got a better reflection from the bootom face of those sockets.', '2004-02-05 06:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(569544, 58484, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, using the garage opening for a frame. IMHO it might have worked better without the fish and with a larger frame. The buildings, which I find the most interesting part of the picture, are way too dark for my taste.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, using the garage opening for a frame. IMHO it might have worked better without the fish and with a larger frame. The buildings, which I find the most interesting part of the picture, are way too dark for my taste.', '2004-02-05 06:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(569547, 57532, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern formed by the openings in the wrenches. I also like the metallic textures. Not involved in the rating, but why HER tools?</td>', 'I like the pattern formed by the openings in the wrenches. I also like the metallic textures. Not involved in the rating, but why HER tools?', '2004-02-05 06:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(569551, 57701, 12733, '<td valign="top">Narrow DOF is a great tool for isolating the subject from an irrelevant background. I think that when you''re photographing a single item - such as this drill - the whole thing should be in focus.</td>', 'Narrow DOF is a great tool for isolating the subject from an irrelevant background. I think that when you''re photographing a single item - such as this drill - the whole thing should be in focus.', '2004-02-05 06:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(569553, 58310, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you would have benefitted from a slightly tighter crop, removing the corner of the wall on the left, and the light-switch on the right. I also think you needed to either include the clutter under the shelves, or remove it completely as it''s leading my eye out of the picture..</td>', 'I think you would have benefitted from a slightly tighter crop, removing the corner of the wall on the left, and the light-switch on the right. I also think you needed to either include the clutter under the shelves, or remove it completely as it''s leading my eye out of the picture..', '2004-02-05 06:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(569555, 58488, 12733, '<td valign="top">A beautiful bike, but the shadows on the motorcycle and the stuff in the background make for a cluttered appearance.</td>', 'A beautiful bike, but the shadows on the motorcycle and the stuff in the background make for a cluttered appearance.', '2004-02-05 06:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569562, 58359, 14614, '<td valign="top">Funny (scored low anyhow -- sorry! - didn''t fit)</td>', 'Funny (scored low anyhow -- sorry! - didn''t fit)', '2004-02-05 07:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(569564, 58242, 14614, '<td valign="top">Not sure what a message pad is.</td>', 'Not sure what a message pad is.', '2004-02-05 07:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569565, 57606, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping and composition - scored lower because it wasn''t in your garage before you shot it.  Sorry</td>', 'Nice cropping and composition - scored lower because it wasn''t in your garage before you shot it.  Sorry', '2004-02-05 07:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(569566, 58102, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the shot BUT it dosen''t fit the theme (in your garage) Sorry.</td>', 'Like the shot BUT it dosen''t fit the theme (in your garage) Sorry.', '2004-02-05 07:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
