(569852, 57471, 12151, '<td valign="top">Good abstract.  Right now, though, it''s got a look that is either not symmetrical enough or not irregular enough to look as good as it could be.</td>', 'Good abstract.  Right now, though, it''s got a look that is either not symmetrical enough or not irregular enough to look as good as it could be.', '2004-02-05 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(569853, 58523, 12151, '<td valign="top">Visually very interesting - excellent B&amp;W.</td>', 'Visually very interesting - excellent B&W.', '2004-02-05 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(569854, 58472, 12151, '<td valign="top">The lines, curves and textures captured are well-captured.  The contrasing brown and blue colors here are very nicely displayed, creating an interesting feel.</td>', 'The lines, curves and textures captured are well-captured.  The contrasing brown and blue colors here are very nicely displayed, creating an interesting feel.', '2004-02-05 12:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(569862, 58463, 12151, '<td valign="top">This looks good visually as an abstract, but the fact that the point of view looks like it''s from your crotch area is a little unnerving (and funny).</td>', 'This looks good visually as an abstract, but the fact that the point of view looks like it''s from your crotch area is a little unnerving (and funny).', '2004-02-05 12:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(569873, 57487, 12252, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not getting the connection to the theme. Perhaps I''m just a bit slow... Nice composition in a way, but then I find myself wondering what is this picture about? Auctioning off motorcycles? Oh! Is that it? They''re auctioning off your motorcycle? If that''s it, then I don''t get why the girls are included in the bottom right. Enough rambling.</td>', 'Sorry, not getting the connection to the theme. Perhaps I''m just a bit slow... Nice composition in a way, but then I find myself wondering what is this picture about? Auctioning off motorcycles? Oh! Is that it? They''re auctioning off your motorcycle? If that''s it, then I don''t get why the girls are included in the bottom right. Enough rambling.', '2004-02-05 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(569874, 57864, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s so black and white and then there''s that great red paint. Good composition. Glad I don''t live in the snow! :-)</td>', 'I like this because it''s so black and white and then there''s that great red paint. Good composition. Glad I don''t live in the snow! :-)', '2004-02-05 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(569875, 57871, 12252, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC, I love the humor. Made me laugh out loud, literally. How long did you have to wait for the snow to re-accumulate after putting the car in the garage sideways? And how long did it take to parallel park? ha! Have to take off a point for the horizon slipping down to the left, but otherwise, a fine garage art picture. 7</td>', 'FANTASTIC, I love the humor. Made me laugh out loud, literally. How long did you have to wait for the snow to re-accumulate after putting the car in the garage sideways? And how long did it take to parallel park? ha! Have to take off a point for the horizon slipping down to the left, but otherwise, a fine garage art picture. 7', '2004-02-05 12:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(569876, 58465, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not much to hold my interest, yellowish background unappealing.</td>', 'Not much to hold my interest, yellowish background unappealing.', '2004-02-05 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(569879, 58359, 12252, '<td valign="top">Kind of a stretch for the theme, but what an expression you''ve captured! It''s a great pic, just not on theme.</td>', 'Kind of a stretch for the theme, but what an expression you''ve captured! It''s a great pic, just not on theme.', '2004-02-05 12:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569881, 58490, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not too keen on the light behind the chessboard upper left. Depth of field could be improved. Hard to do a chessboard that isn''t too cliche, but there''s not much original in this picture. Wonder why you cropped off left hand corner.</td>', 'Not too keen on the light behind the chessboard upper left. Depth of field could be improved. Hard to do a chessboard that isn''t too cliche, but there''s not much original in this picture. Wonder why you cropped off left hand corner.', '2004-02-05 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(569882, 58422, 12252, '<td valign="top">Wish image had been sharper.</td>', 'Wish image had been sharper.', '2004-02-05 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(569883, 57609, 12252, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool. I like that the background is actually an important part of the image. I can almost smell the paint, and the focus is so good the can really pops. considering the subject matter, you''ve done a good job with a really (let''s face it) non-compelling subject! 8...</td>', 'This is kind of cool. I like that the background is actually an important part of the image. I can almost smell the paint, and the focus is so good the can really pops. considering the subject matter, you''ve done a good job with a really (let''s face it) non-compelling subject! 8...', '2004-02-05 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(569884, 57933, 12252, '<td valign="top">Very creative, nicely original, and I''m envious because I don''t get ideas like this! Good execution. Would have liked the nails at about the 2 o''clock position a bit better lit, but that''s a NIT. Should be a top ten finisher!</td>', 'Very creative, nicely original, and I''m envious because I don''t get ideas like this! Good execution. Would have liked the nails at about the 2 o''clock position a bit better lit, but that''s a NIT. Should be a top ten finisher!', '2004-02-05 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(569885, 57433, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Would have liked more depth of field. Maybe a black background or some other color not so similiar to subject.</td>', 'Nicely done. Would have liked more depth of field. Maybe a black background or some other color not so similiar to subject.', '2004-02-05 12:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569886, 58337, 12252, '<td valign="top">Well lit, fairly interesting composition, good (enough) DOF. Maybe a frame of gold and silver?</td>', 'Well lit, fairly interesting composition, good (enough) DOF. Maybe a frame of gold and silver?', '2004-02-05 12:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(569888, 58238, 12252, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The background (wood) looks a bit pale. Would have liked better lighting to eliminate the soft shadows on the "numbers" or go the other way and make the shadows more pronounced.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The background (wood) looks a bit pale. Would have liked better lighting to eliminate the soft shadows on the "numbers" or go the other way and make the shadows more pronounced.', '2004-02-05 12:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(569891, 58310, 12252, '<td valign="top">Composition would have been stronger with nothing under the bottom shelf. Hate to nitpick, but I also wish the object on the brick wall in the bottom right corner was not there. Otherwise, interesting picture! 6</td>', 'Composition would have been stronger with nothing under the bottom shelf. Hate to nitpick, but I also wish the object on the brick wall in the bottom right corner was not there. Otherwise, interesting picture! 6', '2004-02-05 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(569893, 57874, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great colors and the glass is rendered beautifully. You''ve captured the feeling of an old garage very well. 8</td>', 'Nicely done. Great colors and the glass is rendered beautifully. You''ve captured the feeling of an old garage very well. 8', '2004-02-05 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(569895, 58333, 12252, '<td valign="top">I think the image would have been stronger had you limited it to ONE allen wrench in the salad (or whatever) and used conventional silverware and so on. The title is good, but it doesn''t match the image.</td>', 'I think the image would have been stronger had you limited it to ONE allen wrench in the salad (or whatever) and used conventional silverware and so on. The title is good, but it doesn''t match the image.', '2004-02-05 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(569896, 58279, 12252, '<td valign="top">FOCUS! *(*&amp;(* (</td>', 'FOCUS! *(*&(* (', '2004-02-05 13:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(569900, 58373, 12252, '<td valign="top">Love the paintbrushes, hate the background. I realize you were probably trying to show the application of the paint to the walls, but I think the image is stronger with a simple white background.</td>', 'Love the paintbrushes, hate the background. I realize you were probably trying to show the application of the paint to the walls, but I think the image is stronger with a simple white background.', '2004-02-05 13:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(569902, 58505, 12252, '<td valign="top">Needs more or stronger lighting.</td>', 'Needs more or stronger lighting.', '2004-02-05 13:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(569904, 58087, 12252, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think the red on the bottom is distracting. Maybe that''s just me...</td>', 'Personally, I think the red on the bottom is distracting. Maybe that''s just me...', '2004-02-05 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(569905, 58406, 14608, '<td valign="top">Its a little bit overwhelming by number of "art pieces", I think.  Too busy, hard to see it as a whole picture.</td>', 'Its a little bit overwhelming by number of "art pieces", I think.  Too busy, hard to see it as a whole picture.', '2004-02-05 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(569907, 57433, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great composition. A bit more DOF will improve very much the end of the tail. You can do it closing the apperture, with high f numbers.</td>', 'Great composition. A bit more DOF will improve very much the end of the tail. You can do it closing the apperture, with high f numbers.', '2004-02-05 13:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(569908, 58505, 13759, '<td valign="top">A bit so dark. But may be my monitor.</td>', 'A bit so dark. But may be my monitor.', '2004-02-05 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(569909, 58242, 13759, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see clearly now that is a Typical garage stuff in an artistic interpretation.</td>', 'Yes, I can see clearly now that is a Typical garage stuff in an artistic interpretation.', '2004-02-05 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(569912, 57797, 13759, '<td valign="top">WOW, your son lives in a garage? I remember that this challege suposes to be an Art work of typical garage things. Plastic cars are not well fitted in this, it are?</td>', 'WOW, your son lives in a garage? I remember that this challege suposes to be an Art work of typical garage things. Plastic cars are not well fitted in this, it are?', '2004-02-05 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(569914, 58039, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The macro DOF are very shallow, by this you need to crop to center, this area has sharp focus.</td>', 'Good idea. The macro DOF are very shallow, by this you need to crop to center, this area has sharp focus.', '2004-02-05 13:15:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(569915, 58391, 16743, '<td valign="top">The band would surely appriciate this. But theres not much activity.</td>', 'The band would surely appriciate this. But theres not much activity.', '2004-02-05 13:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(569919, 58359, 14608, '<td valign="top">What part of Garage ART is it?</td>', 'What part of Garage ART is it?', '2004-02-05 13:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(569927, 58023, 4967, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t quite look in focus to me... I think, that tools are supposed to be strong, hard things, so they should be pretty sharp.  I can''t quite tell whether this looks like it was a question of compression or something else.  Also the lights glaring off of the clock are really quite bothersome.  I don''t care for the white border just on the two sides, I feel it detracts from the subject.  I do like the repetition and the similar tools getting larger.</td>', 'This doesn''t quite look in focus to me... I think, that tools are supposed to be strong, hard things, so they should be pretty sharp.  I can''t quite tell whether this looks like it was a question of compression or something else.  Also the lights glaring off of the clock are really quite bothersome.  I don''t care for the white border just on the two sides, I feel it detracts from the subject.  I do like the repetition and the similar tools getting larger.', '2004-02-05 13:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(569929, 57487, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what you were going for here... how is this garage art... I guess maybe it''s a garage band?  or a performance from a garage?  The sky bothers me, as it''s not well exposed, I think maybe using a fill flash might have helped here...</td>', 'I''m not really sure what you were going for here... how is this garage art... I guess maybe it''s a garage band?  or a performance from a garage?  The sky bothers me, as it''s not well exposed, I think maybe using a fill flash might have helped here...', '2004-02-05 13:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(569930, 57874, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... very cool... nice job with the exposure, and not getting just pure sillouhettes.  I might suggest maybe cropping a tad bit tighter... to right below the gloves and some on the right... but it''s not a big deal... I think some of your tools need to be used a little more ;-)</td>', 'I like this a lot... very cool... nice job with the exposure, and not getting just pure sillouhettes.  I might suggest maybe cropping a tad bit tighter... to right below the gloves and some on the right... but it''s not a big deal... I think some of your tools need to be used a little more ;-)', '2004-02-05 13:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(569935, 58523, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice capturing of the motion. M.</td>', 'Nice capturing of the motion. M.', '2004-02-05 13:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(569936, 58014, 13025, '<td valign="top">Inspired Title! M.</td>', 'Inspired Title! M.', '2004-02-05 13:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(569937, 58350, 13025, '<td valign="top">Good Idea! M.</td>', 'Good Idea! M.', '2004-02-05 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(569938, 58416, 13025, '<td valign="top">Good Idea and Execution! M.</td>', 'Good Idea and Execution! M.', '2004-02-05 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(569939, 58329, 13025, '<td valign="top">Ready to frame "Garage Art"! Nice colours and exposure. M.</td>', 'Ready to frame "Garage Art"! Nice colours and exposure. M.', '2004-02-05 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(569941, 57609, 13025, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and sharpness! M.</td>', 'Good exposure and sharpness! M.', '2004-02-05 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(569953, 58359, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is one of hte most hilarious photos I''ve ever seen. It would actually have been perfect for "letting go." I love the lips.</td>', 'This is one of hte most hilarious photos I''ve ever seen. It would actually have been perfect for "letting go." I love the lips.', '2004-02-05 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(569955, 58479, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good composition. You pay attention to details. In this line you noticed that 5/8 and 1/2 wrenches are a bit overexposed?</td>', 'Good composition. You pay attention to details. In this line you noticed that 5/8 and 1/2 wrenches are a bit overexposed?', '2004-02-05 14:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(569964, 57753, 13759, '<td valign="top">Where are the garage here?</td>', 'Where are the garage here?', '2004-02-05 14:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(569967, 57606, 13759, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, the sky garage´s. Why you shoot something that don´t meet the challenge? Please, don´t do it.</td>', 'Oh yeah, the sky garage´s. Why you shoot something that don´t meet the challenge? Please, don´t do it.', '2004-02-05 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(569975, 57937, 9462, '<td valign="top">cute idea... nicely done</td>', 'cute idea... nicely done', '2004-02-05 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(569979, 57911, 15207, '<td valign="top">Brave and bold. I really like the lighting. Great capture of garage culture.</td>', 'Brave and bold. I really like the lighting. Great capture of garage culture.', '2004-02-05 14:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(569980, 57606, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Great choice to make it a panoramic. I like the blance of light and dark in the clouds too.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Great choice to make it a panoramic. I like the blance of light and dark in the clouds too.', '2004-02-05 14:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
