(569983, 58490, 9462, '<td valign="top">In your garage?<br/>I really do think you could''ve done better with this. It''s a beautiful board but it doesn''t come across the way you''ve composed this. <br/>Lighting is horrid and the angle is uninteresting.<br/>I can''t even tell the difference between sides. They both look gold.<br/>Try, try again... <br/></td>', 'In your garage?I really do think you could''ve done better with this. It''s a beautiful board but it doesn''t come across the way you''ve composed this. Lighting is horrid and the angle is uninteresting.I can''t even tell the difference between sides. They both look gold.Try, try again... ', '2004-02-05 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(569985, 57532, 9462, '<td valign="top">The socket showing in the bottom right corner is a bit distracting...</td>', 'The socket showing in the bottom right corner is a bit distracting...', '2004-02-05 14:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
