(570015, 57687, 9462, '<td valign="top">A thinker...<br/>Now how would this spark being unplugged?<br/> <br/></td>', 'A thinker...Now how would this spark being unplugged? ', '2004-02-05 15:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(570019, 57911, 9462, '<td valign="top">Dominion not dominium... a 10 nonetheless :)</td>', 'Dominion not dominium... a 10 nonetheless :)', '2004-02-05 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(570037, 58038, 16318, '<td valign="top">great visual!! : )</td>', 'great visual!! : )', '2004-02-05 15:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(570042, 57937, 13749, '<td valign="top">creative, but a bit tilted to the right.  also, it might have looked a bit better with slightly more foreground and then cropping any distracting bits above the garage door.the shoes and other items in the background could be cleaned up for a more simplified look, as well.</td>', 'creative, but a bit tilted to the right.  also, it might have looked a bit better with slightly more foreground and then cropping any distracting bits above the garage door.the shoes and other items in the background could be cleaned up for a more simplified look, as well.', '2004-02-05 15:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(570045, 58465, 16318, '<td valign="top">old boot binding... right?</td>', 'old boot binding... right?', '2004-02-05 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(570046, 58331, 13749, '<td valign="top">although this is a nice image, i think that i would have liked it even more if you had  moved in closer to reveal a bit more of the texture of all these rusted parts, as well as any possible ''landscape'' that you might be able to reveal among them.</td>', 'although this is a nice image, i think that i would have liked it even more if you had  moved in closer to reveal a bit more of the texture of all these rusted parts, as well as any possible ''landscape'' that you might be able to reveal among them.', '2004-02-05 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(570047, 58316, 15920, '<td valign="top">The focus on the heads could have been a little sharper, and the light grey irregularity is distracting.  The pattern and composition are pleasing.</td>', 'The focus on the heads could have been a little sharper, and the light grey irregularity is distracting.  The pattern and composition are pleasing.', '2004-02-05 15:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(570054, 57933, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.  It is simple, has no distracting bright spots, and is clever.  I really like the shadow positioning.</td>', 'This is really well done.  It is simple, has no distracting bright spots, and is clever.  I really like the shadow positioning.', '2004-02-05 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(570056, 58277, 13749, '<td valign="top">combines my strange appeal for pictures of windows with my recent interest in dereliction = i like :D.  unfortunately, it''s a bit small - but i''m sure you''ll here this plenty of times (and probably resent it.. so let''s just pretend i didn''t say that)</td>', 'combines my strange appeal for pictures of windows with my recent interest in dereliction = i like :D.  unfortunately, it''s a bit small - but i''m sure you''ll here this plenty of times (and probably resent it.. so let''s just pretend i didn''t say that)', '2004-02-05 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(570057, 57797, 15920, '<td valign="top">Focus was a little off, and hte line left side background was distracting.  Good colors.</td>', 'Focus was a little off, and hte line left side background was distracting.  Good colors.', '2004-02-05 15:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(570058, 58482, 15920, '<td valign="top">Overexposed a bit.  The lines on the floor in the background don''t support anything and are distracting.</td>', 'Overexposed a bit.  The lines on the floor in the background don''t support anything and are distracting.', '2004-02-05 15:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(570061, 58522, 13749, '<td valign="top">cuttuing off all the parts seems unnecessary, considering the huge amount of negative space you have on the left (or could have stepped back/zoomed out slightly).</td>', 'cuttuing off all the parts seems unnecessary, considering the huge amount of negative space you have on the left (or could have stepped back/zoomed out slightly).', '2004-02-05 15:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(570062, 58513, 15920, '<td valign="top">Reflectoins on the shaft left side are tto bright, and there is a compression artifact on the right side shaft, otherwise, this is a very pleasing composition.</td>', 'Reflectoins on the shaft left side are tto bright, and there is a compression artifact on the right side shaft, otherwise, this is a very pleasing composition.', '2004-02-05 15:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(570063, 57397, 16318, '<td valign="top">wishful thinking!  : )</td>', 'wishful thinking!  : )', '2004-02-05 15:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(570065, 58215, 16318, '<td valign="top">A picture says 1 word!  : )</td>', 'A picture says 1 word!  : )', '2004-02-05 15:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(570067, 58505, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great composition: color, pattern, and background (the webs add a huge sense of locatition), it clearly meets the challenge, and the image is well shot.  This is my favorite so far.</td>', 'Great composition: color, pattern, and background (the webs add a huge sense of locatition), it clearly meets the challenge, and the image is well shot.  This is my favorite so far.', '2004-02-05 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(570069, 58489, 15920, '<td valign="top">Focus was a little off which took away from teh detail a bit.  Colors are great.  I also might have gone for max DOF.</td>', 'Focus was a little off which took away from teh detail a bit.  Colors are great.  I also might have gone for max DOF.', '2004-02-05 15:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(570071, 57871, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great setup, and by far the cleverest image so far.  The cropping at a slight angle didn''t help as the image was interesting enough already to make you think.  The tracks also look a little too clean, as my car usually leaves treads.  Less DOF might have helped your background.  All that said, I really like tihs.</td>', 'Great setup, and by far the cleverest image so far.  The cropping at a slight angle didn''t help as the image was interesting enough already to make you think.  The tracks also look a little too clean, as my car usually leaves treads.  Less DOF might have helped your background.  All that said, I really like tihs.', '2004-02-05 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(570074, 57532, 15920, '<td valign="top">The one overexposed wrench and the background hurt the score a little, but I really liked the composition.</td>', 'The one overexposed wrench and the background hurt the score a little, but I really liked the composition.', '2004-02-05 16:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(570075, 58333, 16318, '<td valign="top">Great fun!!! : )</td>', 'Great fun!!! : )', '2004-02-05 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(570076, 58338, 16318, '<td valign="top">memories!!!!</td>', 'memories!!!!', '2004-02-05 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(570077, 58338, 15920, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus on the engine and less overexposure on the fishing rods would have made this a great compostion.</td>', 'Sharper focus on the engine and less overexposure on the fishing rods would have made this a great compostion.', '2004-02-05 16:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(570078, 58511, 12802, '<td valign="top">They''re too clean looking, musn''t use them much.. :-)<br/> <br/>Like this, good setup.  The LHS seems a little dark.  7</td>', 'They''re too clean looking, musn''t use them much.. :-) Like this, good setup.  The LHS seems a little dark.  7', '2004-02-05 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(570080, 58531, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like this idea!!  Pity they are different sizes...  Good reflections at the bottom.  Border''s a bit bold though.  8</td>', 'Very nice, like this idea!!  Pity they are different sizes...  Good reflections at the bottom.  Border''s a bit bold though.  8', '2004-02-05 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(570081, 58523, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Excellent use of motion and stationary objects together.  Best B&amp;W of the competition.</td>', 'Great shot.  Excellent use of motion and stationary objects together.  Best B&W of the competition.', '2004-02-05 16:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(570084, 58288, 15920, '<td valign="top">Border looks like it was more work than it was worth because I think it detracted from the simplicity on this shot.  Colors are great, and technique wise, this is a great shot.</td>', 'Border looks like it was more work than it was worth because I think it detracted from the simplicity on this shot.  Colors are great, and technique wise, this is a great shot.', '2004-02-05 16:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(570086, 58373, 15920, '<td valign="top">Focus on bristles could have been stronger.  I might be the only one, but I think your border really helped this shot.</td>', 'Focus on bristles could have been stronger.  I might be the only one, but I think your border really helped this shot.', '2004-02-05 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(570087, 57753, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I would have cropped the horizon level.</td>', 'Great colors.  I would have cropped the horizon level.', '2004-02-05 16:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(570088, 57886, 15920, '<td valign="top">Background was a little busy.  The title, and use of the old game were great.</td>', 'Background was a little busy.  The title, and use of the old game were great.', '2004-02-05 16:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(570092, 58292, 15920, '<td valign="top">Colors are oversaturated and the focus point is unclear to me.  Good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Colors are oversaturated and the focus point is unclear to me.  Good idea for the challenge.', '2004-02-05 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(570093, 57397, 15920, '<td valign="top">Hope you are a Patriots fan.....I like the siloutte effect, but the junk in the corner takes away from a very good portrait.</td>', 'Hope you are a Patriots fan.....I like the siloutte effect, but the junk in the corner takes away from a very good portrait.', '2004-02-05 16:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(570095, 58406, 4648, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like your light source.  This in itself draws me to this.  Right now it''s an 8 but I''ll be back to look again.</td>', 'I REALLY like your light source.  This in itself draws me to this.  Right now it''s an 8 but I''ll be back to look again.', '2004-02-05 16:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
