(570565, 58023, 12252, '<td valign="top">Well, let''s see. Focus isn''t there, there are hot spots on the clock, the composition isn''t terribly interesting, and I don''t get why there''s all that white space on either side.</td>', 'Well, let''s see. Focus isn''t there, there are hot spots on the clock, the composition isn''t terribly interesting, and I don''t get why there''s all that white space on either side.', '2004-02-06 02:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(570566, 58512, 12252, '<td valign="top">I think you''re trying to make a parallel to a graveyard, right? Not sure you really pulled it off, if that''s the case. Interesting idea, tho</td>', 'I think you''re trying to make a parallel to a graveyard, right? Not sure you really pulled it off, if that''s the case. Interesting idea, tho', '2004-02-06 02:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(570567, 57937, 12252, '<td valign="top">Darn neat idea and pretty well executed, but there are some nits. (Isn''t there always?) You should rotate the image 1 degree to the left, crop out more of the driveway and the roof. Still, a very nicely done image that meets the challenge and is quite creative. 8</td>', 'Darn neat idea and pretty well executed, but there are some nits. (Isn''t there always?) You should rotate the image 1 degree to the left, crop out more of the driveway and the roof. Still, a very nicely done image that meets the challenge and is quite creative. 8', '2004-02-06 02:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(570569, 57726, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title. I like the image but wish the measuring tape were in focus.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title. I like the image but wish the measuring tape were in focus.', '2004-02-06 02:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(570570, 58489, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this image. I would have cropped off a smidgeon more on th left (eliminating the bricks in the lower left). Wish the machinery were darker.</td>', 'I like this image. I would have cropped off a smidgeon more on th left (eliminating the bricks in the lower left). Wish the machinery were darker.', '2004-02-06 02:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(570571, 58493, 12252, '<td valign="top">Besides poor DOF, the composition isn''t very compelling.</td>', 'Besides poor DOF, the composition isn''t very compelling.', '2004-02-06 02:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(570572, 58506, 12252, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what I''m looking at except some phone cords? What''s the thing with the smiley face on it?</td>', 'Can''t really tell what I''m looking at except some phone cords? What''s the thing with the smiley face on it?', '2004-02-06 02:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(570574, 58532, 12252, '<td valign="top">ANOTHER collection of bolts. Pretty, I suppose, but not much in the composition to hold my interest, sorry!</td>', 'ANOTHER collection of bolts. Pretty, I suppose, but not much in the composition to hold my interest, sorry!', '2004-02-06 02:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(570575, 58468, 12252, '<td valign="top">Wish I had your garage! Nice treatment, like the colors a lot. Giving it a 7</td>', 'Wish I had your garage! Nice treatment, like the colors a lot. Giving it a 7', '2004-02-06 02:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(570578, 58265, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title in relation to the image, and I''m not altogether sure what I''m looking at in the image. I do like the sparks from the blade, but what is it cutting? And what''s with all the black on the right half of the picture?</td>', 'I don''t understand the title in relation to the image, and I''m not altogether sure what I''m looking at in the image. I do like the sparks from the blade, but what is it cutting? And what''s with all the black on the right half of the picture?', '2004-02-06 02:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(570580, 57459, 12252, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get a lot of heat for the background, but I like it. Great focus on the wrench, too. Unfortunately, the image doesn''t hold my attention very long. No dynamic tension for instance.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get a lot of heat for the background, but I like it. Great focus on the wrench, too. Unfortunately, the image doesn''t hold my attention very long. No dynamic tension for instance.', '2004-02-06 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(570581, 57988, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot, even though I didn''t care much for the title. The image stands by itself, however. I like the sepia / black. Might have been a bit more interesting with a 3 pixel white border inside a black border. But that''s me. &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'I like this image a lot, even though I didn''t care much for the title. The image stands by itself, however. I like the sepia / black. Might have been a bit more interesting with a 3 pixel white border inside a black border. But that''s me. <g>', '2004-02-06 02:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(570582, 58329, 6130, '<td valign="top">Good imagination.</td>', 'Good imagination.', '2004-02-06 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(570583, 58406, 12252, '<td valign="top">Great focus, uneven light, and way too busy (although that''s the point, right?)</td>', 'Great focus, uneven light, and way too busy (although that''s the point, right?)', '2004-02-06 02:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(570584, 58131, 6130, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2004-02-06 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(570585, 58511, 12252, '<td valign="top">Technically well done. Just a smidge greater DOF would have been nice for the handles on the screwdrivers, but hey... My only complaint is that it''s almost TOO symetrical. Also -- are there wrinkles in the background?</td>', 'Technically well done. Just a smidge greater DOF would have been nice for the handles on the screwdrivers, but hey... My only complaint is that it''s almost TOO symetrical. Also -- are there wrinkles in the background?', '2004-02-06 02:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(570586, 58133, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-02-06 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(570588, 58531, 12252, '<td valign="top">I rather like this one. The background bugs me a little and the frame seems to fat, but I like the screws. I keep coming back to the fact that they''re not the same size and thinking they either SHOULD be, or there should be ONE that''s really smaller, or something. Can''t get my arms around it. But I still like your picture! :-) Gave it a 7</td>', 'I rather like this one. The background bugs me a little and the frame seems to fat, but I like the screws. I keep coming back to the fact that they''re not the same size and thinking they either SHOULD be, or there should be ONE that''s really smaller, or something. Can''t get my arms around it. But I still like your picture! :-) Gave it a 7', '2004-02-06 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(570589, 58474, 12252, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Guess you don''t spend much time puttering out there! Good strong image, I like the b&amp;w, and I think you cropped it perfectly. Good frame as well. 8</td>', 'Yikes! Guess you don''t spend much time puttering out there! Good strong image, I like the b&w, and I think you cropped it perfectly. Good frame as well. 8', '2004-02-06 02:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(570590, 58420, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I would have cropped off most of the white stuff on the bottom. Good patterns, DOF, etc. I gave it an 8</td>', 'Nicely done. I would have cropped off most of the white stuff on the bottom. Good patterns, DOF, etc. I gave it an 8', '2004-02-06 02:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(570591, 58533, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this image, even with all that negative space. But the lighting on the keys has to be perfect to pull this off, and I think it needs improvement.</td>', 'I like this image, even with all that negative space. But the lighting on the keys has to be perfect to pull this off, and I think it needs improvement.', '2004-02-06 02:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(570593, 58039, 12252, '<td valign="top">Huh? I really don''t get what you''re trying to communicate with this image. Can''t understand how it relates to the challenge, either. ..</td>', 'Huh? I really don''t get what you''re trying to communicate with this image. Can''t understand how it relates to the challenge, either. ..', '2004-02-06 02:34:54.000000', NULL, 1);
