(570810, 57992, 15770, '<td valign="top">I love the color and shading -- how the yellow goes from light to dark, corner to corner.  I like that it was off-center.  However, I find the bottom angle distracting.  I think it would have looked better if it were either straight across the bottom, or if the angle were more deliberate.</td>', 'I love the color and shading -- how the yellow goes from light to dark, corner to corner.  I like that it was off-center.  However, I find the bottom angle distracting.  I think it would have looked better if it were either straight across the bottom, or if the angle were more deliberate.', '2004-02-06 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(570811, 57673, 15645, '<td valign="top">Wow, a pretty great concept. Amusing how many nails and screws are in this contest :)<br/>An 8 from me</td>', 'Wow, a pretty great concept. Amusing how many nails and screws are in this contest :)An 8 from me', '2004-02-06 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
