(571300, 57871, 16603, '<td valign="top">WHAT!?  good picture, great idea to fool eye.   It fooled me...for a second.  When tires go over snow they smash it down not remove it completely.</td>', 'WHAT!?  good picture, great idea to fool eye.   It fooled me...for a second.  When tires go over snow they smash it down not remove it completely.', '2004-02-06 18:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
