(571771, 58277, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  This is the first "pretty" entry that I''ve seen for this category.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  This is the first "pretty" entry that I''ve seen for this category.', '2004-02-07 09:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(571773, 57471, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect and composition.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect and composition.  Well done.', '2004-02-07 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(571774, 58453, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and goot lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition and goot lighting.', '2004-02-07 09:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(571788, 57924, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, you did something creative while following the topic closely</td>', 'I like this a lot, you did something creative while following the topic closely', '2004-02-07 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(571789, 57504, 11895, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2004-02-07 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(571799, 58193, 3423, '<td valign="top">The truck alone would have been a far stronger photo. Adding the potted plant has only distracted the eye away from the far more interesting rustic detail of the truck.</td>', 'The truck alone would have been a far stronger photo. Adding the potted plant has only distracted the eye away from the far more interesting rustic detail of the truck.', '2004-02-07 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(571801, 58359, 15690, '<td valign="top">My heart goes out to you.  I wonder if Charlie would let you stay in his garage?<br/>I don''t think soooo!</td>', 'My heart goes out to you.  I wonder if Charlie would let you stay in his garage?I don''t think soooo!', '2004-02-07 10:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(571813, 57871, 14956, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how you got that in there?</td>', 'I would love to know how you got that in there?', '2004-02-07 11:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(571817, 58489, 16266, '<td valign="top">I had this image lower and i have been bumping it up a few socres.  I really like the lines, flow and simplicity of this.  Perhas it is cropped a bit too tight on the left creating tension... either more or less but not RIGHT ON the edge... Good exposure.  Well actually.. i am not sure i see any REAL blacks... they seem just ALMOST black to me... in addition to the bricks looking like they could have  a little more depth (being a little darker would do this).. but i reall liked it... great image... almost perfect.</td>', 'I had this image lower and i have been bumping it up a few socres.  I really like the lines, flow and simplicity of this.  Perhas it is cropped a bit too tight on the left creating tension... either more or less but not RIGHT ON the edge... Good exposure.  Well actually.. i am not sure i see any REAL blacks... they seem just ALMOST black to me... in addition to the bricks looking like they could have  a little more depth (being a little darker would do this).. but i reall liked it... great image... almost perfect.', '2004-02-07 11:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(571819, 57479, 16266, '<td valign="top">The image seems very soft / out of focus.  The whites on the back of the boy''s shirt are burnt out.  I like the formal elements of the image, but they are weekend by a few things.  The boys head is cropped RIGHT where it meets the top of the image.  This is a no no and creates tension and makes my eye leave the picture.  It should be cropped (IMO) either further down or farther up.  From the angle you took it, it would be hard to get the pillar vertical and the boy still looking natural but i think it would be worth a try.  I KNOW pillars are vertical.. and it ''doest really work'' to have them on a ''slight'' slant ... but good eye for something interesting..and good luck further.  I DID like the image, despite the problems i had with it.. and remember these are just MY thoughts... not everyones.</td>', 'The image seems very soft / out of focus.  The whites on the back of the boy''s shirt are burnt out.  I like the formal elements of the image, but they are weekend by a few things.  The boys head is cropped RIGHT where it meets the top of the image.  This is a no no and creates tension and makes my eye leave the picture.  It should be cropped (IMO) either further down or farther up.  From the angle you took it, it would be hard to get the pillar vertical and the boy still looking natural but i think it would be worth a try.  I KNOW pillars are vertical.. and it ''doest really work'' to have them on a ''slight'' slant ... but good eye for something interesting..and good luck further.  I DID like the image, despite the problems i had with it.. and remember these are just MY thoughts... not everyones.', '2004-02-07 11:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(571821, 58415, 16266, '<td valign="top">Due to the vary dark shadows, it appears as though there is one primary light souce.  This makes this image very contrasty (too contrasty) making the highlights burned out, and little detail in the darks.  The pencil on the top is way too light.. .it grabs my eye for all the aattention then has nothing in it for detail to keep it there.  It is an interesting concept to have all the tools interacting with eachtoher.. but perhaps a little busy.  Maybe it would be interesting to have just one interaction.. oh hhh all except the pencil.. it isn''t interacting at all.  Good start. keep up the good work.</td>', 'Due to the vary dark shadows, it appears as though there is one primary light souce.  This makes this image very contrasty (too contrasty) making the highlights burned out, and little detail in the darks.  The pencil on the top is way too light.. .it grabs my eye for all the aattention then has nothing in it for detail to keep it there.  It is an interesting concept to have all the tools interacting with eachtoher.. but perhaps a little busy.  Maybe it would be interesting to have just one interaction.. oh hhh all except the pencil.. it isn''t interacting at all.  Good start. keep up the good work.', '2004-02-07 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(571827, 57370, 16777, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, really well done. Just wondering how badly you screwed up the blade on your Makita?<br/></td>', 'I like this shot, really well done. Just wondering how badly you screwed up the blade on your Makita?', '2004-02-07 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(571829, 57708, 16777, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I think a little more subdued background might have worked better, seems too stark.</td>', 'Good shot, but I think a little more subdued background might have worked better, seems too stark.', '2004-02-07 12:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(571832, 57871, 11248, '<td valign="top">Funny picture. Not sure about art expression but interresting.-7</td>', 'Funny picture. Not sure about art expression but interresting.-7', '2004-02-07 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(571843, 57937, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped the top to give it about the same size from the top of the garage door as on the sides, and left more at the bottom if possible</td>', 'I think I would have cropped the top to give it about the same size from the top of the garage door as on the sides, and left more at the bottom if possible', '2004-02-07 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(571845, 58338, 16777, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, seems a bit to uneven lighting wise.</td>', 'Interesting subject, seems a bit to uneven lighting wise.', '2004-02-07 13:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(571859, 58288, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice bright colors but the background is too bright, it has lost all it''s texture except for a couple areas where it is shaded</td>', 'nice bright colors but the background is too bright, it has lost all it''s texture except for a couple areas where it is shaded', '2004-02-07 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(571869, 58520, 11895, '<td valign="top">wish this wasn''t so dark</td>', 'wish this wasn''t so dark', '2004-02-07 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(571884, 58359, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very humorous outtake on this challenge. It''s good that you didn''t give up not having garage... The picture is very sharp and clean.  It''s as if the sheep is crying over not having her own garage. Well shot humour. 10</td>', 'Very humorous outtake on this challenge. It''s good that you didn''t give up not having garage... The picture is very sharp and clean.  It''s as if the sheep is crying over not having her own garage. Well shot humour. 10', '2004-02-07 13:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(571889, 57487, 811, '<td valign="top">Okay, I guess I''m dense.  I don''t see the connection to the challenge.  I''ll assume I am missing a finer nuance of the meaning of the word "garage."<br/>Photographically speaking, I think the composition could have been simplified and strengthened.  My attention goes from the ladies in the front ot the man standing to the smoke in teh background, and out of the frame.  If there had been a way to isolate the man standing, I think the picture would have carried much more emotional appeal.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Okay, I guess I''m dense.  I don''t see the connection to the challenge.  I''ll assume I am missing a finer nuance of the meaning of the word "garage."Photographically speaking, I think the composition could have been simplified and strengthened.  My attention goes from the ladies in the front ot the man standing to the smoke in teh background, and out of the frame.  If there had been a way to isolate the man standing, I think the picture would have carried much more emotional appeal.Good luck.', '2004-02-07 13:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(571892, 58531, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dof you have chosen to use here.  Adn the colors are rich and deep.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the dof you have chosen to use here.  Adn the colors are rich and deep.  Nice work.', '2004-02-07 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(571893, 58411, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s cool looking.  I like the colors.  I do think the composition would have been more dynamic if it were set on a "diagonal" rather than an almost straight horizontal.</td>', 'That''s cool looking.  I like the colors.  I do think the composition would have been more dynamic if it were set on a "diagonal" rather than an almost straight horizontal.', '2004-02-07 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(571896, 58515, 811, '<td valign="top">The light seems to be blowing out some of the detail on the top edge.  I like the "background" texture, though.</td>', 'The light seems to be blowing out some of the detail on the top edge.  I like the "background" texture, though.', '2004-02-07 13:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(571898, 58130, 811, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field, though I think it would have been more effective if the top of the screws were sharper.  BW works well with this.</td>', 'Great depth of field, though I think it would have been more effective if the top of the screws were sharper.  BW works well with this.', '2004-02-07 13:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(571899, 57864, 811, '<td valign="top">Ouch, that looks like a nice bike.  cover it up with something!!!<br/> <br/>I like how the red stands out in the picture.  Overall, I think the focus needed to be better -- it looks a bit grainy like perhaps the aperture number was too small, or you adjusted the brightness/contrast in post processing.</td>', 'Ouch, that looks like a nice bike.  cover it up with something!!! I like how the red stands out in the picture.  Overall, I think the focus needed to be better -- it looks a bit grainy like perhaps the aperture number was too small, or you adjusted the brightness/contrast in post processing.', '2004-02-07 13:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(571900, 58511, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  You have what appear to be jaggies up where the label is, but I have seen that a lot on my pictures, and it isn''t that.  Certain diagonal lines just appear that way.  Sometimes rotating them a degree or two helps, and it isn''t visible on larger sizes of the pictures.  It also doesn''t show up on prints.</td>', 'I like the composition.  You have what appear to be jaggies up where the label is, but I have seen that a lot on my pictures, and it isn''t that.  Certain diagonal lines just appear that way.  Sometimes rotating them a degree or two helps, and it isn''t visible on larger sizes of the pictures.  It also doesn''t show up on prints.', '2004-02-07 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(571901, 57609, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture of detail.</td>', 'Good capture of detail.', '2004-02-07 13:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(571902, 58392, 811, '<td valign="top">Hope nothing was injured!  Good idea.  I like the simplicity of the bw.</td>', 'Hope nothing was injured!  Good idea.  I like the simplicity of the bw.', '2004-02-07 13:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(571903, 58534, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I like the simplicity that he black/white/blue sets up with the silhouette.</td>', 'Cool effect.  I like the simplicity that he black/white/blue sets up with the silhouette.', '2004-02-07 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(571904, 58522, 811, '<td valign="top">There''s too much black space on the left.  More would have been effective as negative space and less would have made the composition feel more balanced, I think.</td>', 'There''s too much black space on the left.  More would have been effective as negative space and less would have made the composition feel more balanced, I think.', '2004-02-07 14:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(571965, 58102, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Wonderful shot.  "frame" is awesome, as is the green in the shot , and  the perspective.    Great one.  10</td>', 'Very creative.  Wonderful shot.  "frame" is awesome, as is the green in the shot , and  the perspective.    Great one.  10', '2004-02-07 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
