(572187, 58329, 15242, '<td valign="top">Good luck getting the paint off the grout.  Nice shot, good use of color.</td>', 'Good luck getting the paint off the grout.  Nice shot, good use of color.', '2004-02-07 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
