(572403, 58467, 3540, '<td valign="top">this is just a little bit underexposed for my tastes.  A little bit brighter would''ve done you good here I think.  This is a nice composition and a well taken photo, just a pinch dark.7</td>', 'this is just a little bit underexposed for my tastes.  A little bit brighter would''ve done you good here I think.  This is a nice composition and a well taken photo, just a pinch dark.7', '2004-02-08 10:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(572405, 58454, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what purpose cutting both of these off serves.  Nice toning to the pictures and I believe the subjects are pretty good.  why cut them off?  and both of them to boot.</td>', 'I''m not sure what purpose cutting both of these off serves.  Nice toning to the pictures and I believe the subjects are pretty good.  why cut them off?  and both of them to boot.', '2004-02-08 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(572408, 57687, 3540, '<td valign="top">Best I''ve seen so far.  GOod work with the lighting on this one.  Only thing I think could be a bit better is that the rest of the photo could have a little bit more exposure.  Almost looks like another paint with light entry.  And one that would''ve really done well too.  I expect this will be in the ribbons, but I''ve been wrong before.9</td>', 'Best I''ve seen so far.  GOod work with the lighting on this one.  Only thing I think could be a bit better is that the rest of the photo could have a little bit more exposure.  Almost looks like another paint with light entry.  And one that would''ve really done well too.  I expect this will be in the ribbons, but I''ve been wrong before.9', '2004-02-08 10:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
