(573246, 58505, 6624, '<td valign="top">lovely soft light, nice composition</td>', 'lovely soft light, nice composition', '2004-02-09 10:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(573247, 57398, 6008, '<td valign="top">The idea, and title, is good. The image is a little small and the focus on the items is slightly blurry. Tthe light from the upper left is a little too strong and has caused some hot spots, which also makes the darker fringe on the right more noticable.</td>', 'The idea, and title, is good. The image is a little small and the focus on the items is slightly blurry. Tthe light from the upper left is a little too strong and has caused some hot spots, which also makes the darker fringe on the right more noticable.', '2004-02-09 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(573251, 57928, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract idea. The image looks a little blurry, especially the farther out of the image you look, I dont know if the filter was in use when you took the shot and that is the result of vibration/motion. The greyscale is also a little flat. Playing around with the brightness/contrast can add a little more depth to the tonal range of the black and white.</td>', 'Interesting abstract idea. The image looks a little blurry, especially the farther out of the image you look, I dont know if the filter was in use when you took the shot and that is the result of vibration/motion. The greyscale is also a little flat. Playing around with the brightness/contrast can add a little more depth to the tonal range of the black and white.', '2004-02-09 10:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(573255, 58461, 6008, '<td valign="top">The main problem I have with this is that you are showing action without the action. It doesnt look like a natural position to find these items in, they look deliberately staged and so loses the impact of the ''shatter''. Understandable you didnt really want a hand in the shot, but had you held the hammer at a diagonal off into one of the corners it would have helped give the impression of being ''in action''.</td>', 'The main problem I have with this is that you are showing action without the action. It doesnt look like a natural position to find these items in, they look deliberately staged and so loses the impact of the ''shatter''. Understandable you didnt really want a hand in the shot, but had you held the hammer at a diagonal off into one of the corners it would have helped give the impression of being ''in action''.', '2004-02-09 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(573270, 57476, 6008, '<td valign="top">The chrome almost looks golden instead of the usual silver, but I like it. Both the metal and the background has good textures with complimentary tones. The shapes are also interesting in an abstract way too. Good shot.</td>', 'The chrome almost looks golden instead of the usual silver, but I like it. Both the metal and the background has good textures with complimentary tones. The shapes are also interesting in an abstract way too. Good shot.', '2004-02-09 10:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(573306, 58346, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure you really needed the ''person'' but it adds humor. I really like the warm tone of the image, coupled with the texture of the wood is really great. DOF is good too. The hot spots on the heads of the two screws are a little distracting, but not overly so. Interesting image.</td>', 'Not sure you really needed the ''person'' but it adds humor. I really like the warm tone of the image, coupled with the texture of the wood is really great. DOF is good too. The hot spots on the heads of the two screws are a little distracting, but not overly so. Interesting image.', '2004-02-09 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(573311, 58539, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred to see this with a different background, something with a contrasting color and interesting texture. I really like the bottle - it''s full of character and the lighting is good. The ''new'' background just steals the thunder of the old bottle. It''s a good shot, though, could see it being used in advertising.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred to see this with a different background, something with a contrasting color and interesting texture. I really like the bottle - it''s full of character and the lighting is good. The ''new'' background just steals the thunder of the old bottle. It''s a good shot, though, could see it being used in advertising.', '2004-02-09 11:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(573313, 57609, 6008, '<td valign="top">I guess the background could be a pair of old drapes/curtains or something, but it looks too ''glamorous'' a setting for an old stained paint can. The lighting is good, the can is nicely sharp and clear, and I like the texture of the backdrop.</td>', 'I guess the background could be a pair of old drapes/curtains or something, but it looks too ''glamorous'' a setting for an old stained paint can. The lighting is good, the can is nicely sharp and clear, and I like the texture of the backdrop.', '2004-02-09 11:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(573317, 58479, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is good and the wrenches are nicely sharp and clean. You''ve lost a little bit of the texture/color on the two nearest wrenches but not distractingly so. A technically good image.</td>', 'Composition is good and the wrenches are nicely sharp and clean. You''ve lost a little bit of the texture/color on the two nearest wrenches but not distractingly so. A technically good image.', '2004-02-09 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(573318, 57624, 6008, '<td valign="top">The texture of both the floor and the leaf are good but the leaf doesnt really spring out from the shot. The placement is good, but maybe getting a little bit closer may have brought out more of the textures of the leaf. A slight brightness/levels adjustment may have helped a little, and the leaf looks a little soft too.</td>', 'The texture of both the floor and the leaf are good but the leaf doesnt really spring out from the shot. The placement is good, but maybe getting a little bit closer may have brought out more of the textures of the leaf. A slight brightness/levels adjustment may have helped a little, and the leaf looks a little soft too.', '2004-02-09 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(573321, 58542, 6008, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the ''machine'' is but it looks old and really sets the tone for the image. The sepia toning is wonderful, and the slight grain gives it a nice gritty texture too. The toilet adds humor, but also serves to break up the browns, and it doesnt look out of place either. Great shot!</td>', 'I have no idea what the ''machine'' is but it looks old and really sets the tone for the image. The sepia toning is wonderful, and the slight grain gives it a nice gritty texture too. The toilet adds humor, but also serves to break up the browns, and it doesnt look out of place either. Great shot!', '2004-02-09 11:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(573327, 58453, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little uneven on the lower section, but not overly distractly. I like the ''imperfection'' of the wrenches with the scratches, it gives the chrome some texture. The image is also very sharp and clear. Well shot!</td>', 'The lighting is a little uneven on the lower section, but not overly distractly. I like the ''imperfection'' of the wrenches with the scratches, it gives the chrome some texture. The image is also very sharp and clear. Well shot!', '2004-02-09 11:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(573329, 58381, 6008, '<td valign="top">Almost a low-key camoflage shot! The texture in this shot really stands out, and the black/grey is a nice strong color too. Placement of the hat is good, and of course the fact that it blends so well with the background seems to be the whole point of the shot! It''s different, and I like it!</td>', 'Almost a low-key camoflage shot! The texture in this shot really stands out, and the black/grey is a nice strong color too. Placement of the hat is good, and of course the fact that it blends so well with the background seems to be the whole point of the shot! It''s different, and I like it!', '2004-02-09 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(573418, 58238, 9581, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2004-02-09 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(573446, 57871, 9581, '<td valign="top">haha how that get in there sideways? or how long did it take to drive it in there?</td>', 'haha how that get in there sideways? or how long did it take to drive it in there?', '2004-02-09 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(573482, 58265, 17055, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2004-02-09 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(573526, 57911, 13438, '<td valign="top">Nicest photo i found in this contest. Sad the t-shirt is burned out. 9</td>', 'Nicest photo i found in this contest. Sad the t-shirt is burned out. 9', '2004-02-09 14:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(573527, 58534, 13438, '<td valign="top">I like this pic a lot, because of the impression of quite concentration</td>', 'I like this pic a lot, because of the impression of quite concentration', '2004-02-09 14:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(573529, 57687, 13438, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. I would have pushed the contrast of the candle''s body, so to obtain a whiter (porcelain?) body.Pardon my french :) 8</td>', 'One of my favorites. I would have pushed the contrast of the candle''s body, so to obtain a whiter (porcelain?) body.Pardon my french :) 8', '2004-02-09 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(573565, 58310, 6132, '<td valign="top">LOL...I knew a kitten would somehow sneak into the challenge :o)</td>', 'LOL...I knew a kitten would somehow sneak into the challenge :o)', '2004-02-09 15:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(573589, 58133, 16957, '<td valign="top">Enigmatic. Garage Art? Not sure I get it but then often I don''t!</td>', 'Enigmatic. Garage Art? Not sure I get it but then often I don''t!', '2004-02-09 16:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
