(573644, 58519, 16957, '<td valign="top">Well done! This works a treat. Ehhhh but why is the hammer facing the wrong way round for hammering? I take it that''s part of the ''art'' Deserves a top 10.</td>', 'Well done! This works a treat. Ehhhh but why is the hammer facing the wrong way round for hammering? I take it that''s part of the ''art'' Deserves a top 10.', '2004-02-09 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(573648, 58102, 16957, '<td valign="top">Like it - not sure about angle though. Excellent colours and textures though.</td>', 'Like it - not sure about angle though. Excellent colours and textures though.', '2004-02-09 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(573698, 58533, 16957, '<td valign="top">Atractive photo. Keys would benefit from being sharper though...</td>', 'Atractive photo. Keys would benefit from being sharper though...', '2004-02-09 17:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(573699, 58502, 16957, '<td valign="top">Interesting but colours too saturated from my liking. You''ve got a good photo here though.</td>', 'Interesting but colours too saturated from my liking. You''ve got a good photo here though.', '2004-02-09 17:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(573703, 57708, 16957, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition but where''s the oil? Funny - haven''t yet seen any good shots of oil in this challenge yet to me it''s an obvious choice for a study. A bit of oil in this shot and I''d have added another point!</td>', 'Lovely composition but where''s the oil? Funny - haven''t yet seen any good shots of oil in this challenge yet to me it''s an obvious choice for a study. A bit of oil in this shot and I''d have added another point!', '2004-02-09 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(573706, 58501, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. TO many of these objects clash for attention though. A bit more time selecting one or two and thinking about angle of shot, composition and framing would have helped. Example - that jack is an ideal object for playing around with and seeing how its function (lifting very heavy things) could be reflected in a composition.</td>', 'Nice idea. TO many of these objects clash for attention though. A bit more time selecting one or two and thinking about angle of shot, composition and framing would have helped. Example - that jack is an ideal object for playing around with and seeing how its function (lifting very heavy things) could be reflected in a composition.', '2004-02-09 17:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(573707, 57964, 16957, '<td valign="top">Yeh right! Very Andy Warhol. nicely taken shot. You get a score for schmuptz.</td>', 'Yeh right! Very Andy Warhol. nicely taken shot. You get a score for schmuptz.', '2004-02-09 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(573710, 58103, 16957, '<td valign="top">baby wrench and daddy wrench?</td>', 'baby wrench and daddy wrench?', '2004-02-09 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(573712, 58479, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Pity the engraving on wrenches wasn''t a bit sharper..</td>', 'Nicely done. Pity the engraving on wrenches wasn''t a bit sharper..', '2004-02-09 17:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(573713, 58310, 16957, '<td valign="top">like it - especially lighting and soft focus.</td>', 'like it - especially lighting and soft focus.', '2004-02-09 17:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(573715, 58381, 16957, '<td valign="top">When the day is done and I still can''t really think about garage art? Sorry - don''t see the link but since it''s maybe just me the shot still gets a good score for its beauty.</td>', 'When the day is done and I still can''t really think about garage art? Sorry - don''t see the link but since it''s maybe just me the shot still gets a good score for its beauty.', '2004-02-09 17:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(573717, 58391, 16957, '<td valign="top">An idea that has been picked up widely by challengers. Look at other entries and see how they manage to do this better. Lighting, texture, focus and framing need more thought here. I get impression this was done in a hurry but given another 30min of experimenting (which digital cameras allow), you could have got a much better shot.</td>', 'An idea that has been picked up widely by challengers. Look at other entries and see how they manage to do this better. Lighting, texture, focus and framing need more thought here. I get impression this was done in a hurry but given another 30min of experimenting (which digital cameras allow), you could have got a much better shot.', '2004-02-09 17:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(573719, 57703, 16957, '<td valign="top">Fine composition but take away the tube in foreground, sort out shadows on left hand bottle and sharpen up the focus and there''s the basis for a lovely study.</td>', 'Fine composition but take away the tube in foreground, sort out shadows on left hand bottle and sharpen up the focus and there''s the basis for a lovely study.', '2004-02-09 17:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(573720, 58532, 16957, '<td valign="top">This out of focus framing is catchign on (see 2nd place Things that go together). This photo works for me. gorgeous colour and just theright focus.</td>', 'This out of focus framing is catchign on (see 2nd place Things that go together). This photo works for me. gorgeous colour and just theright focus.', '2004-02-09 17:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(573840, 58519, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Very creative effective.  Though it bothers me that I could look at this as if the model is hammering his shoulder.  Painful.  Still, lovely affect.</td>', 'I like this.  Very creative effective.  Though it bothers me that I could look at this as if the model is hammering his shoulder.  Painful.  Still, lovely affect.', '2004-02-09 19:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(573841, 58103, 12131, '<td valign="top">Parent and child maybe?  I like the relationship style in this.</td>', 'Parent and child maybe?  I like the relationship style in this.', '2004-02-09 19:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(573844, 57877, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  You have the classy and the rusty together.  Solid contrast.  Is that a sweet or dry red wine?</td>', 'Nice image.  You have the classy and the rusty together.  Solid contrast.  Is that a sweet or dry red wine?', '2004-02-09 19:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
