(574610, 58472, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo, love the texture and color. well-composed. there''s a mood here and I like the character of the subject. 10</td>', 'beautiful photo, love the texture and color. well-composed. there''s a mood here and I like the character of the subject. 10', '2004-02-10 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
