(574989, 58531, 8125, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that I wish these screws were all the same height.  The more I looked at it though, I''m thinking that it''s also cool that they aren''t.  I really like the reflection beneath them.  Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'My first thought was that I wish these screws were all the same height.  The more I looked at it though, I''m thinking that it''s also cool that they aren''t.  I really like the reflection beneath them.  Good lighting and composition.', '2004-02-10 20:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(574995, 58502, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I don''t really like the weave in the blue background.  I would probably prefer this same thing with a solid background.  Also, this seems like it may be a bit over processed (maybe too much sharpening or contrast?)  The lighting is good....</td>', 'I like the idea.  I don''t really like the weave in the blue background.  I would probably prefer this same thing with a solid background.  Also, this seems like it may be a bit over processed (maybe too much sharpening or contrast?)  The lighting is good....', '2004-02-10 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(574997, 57398, 8125, '<td valign="top">The image size is a bit small.  Your lighting is off, too bright on the left side, bordering on getting dark on the right side, and there is too much shadow.  Your subject has lost a lot of detail.</td>', 'The image size is a bit small.  Your lighting is off, too bright on the left side, bordering on getting dark on the right side, and there is too much shadow.  Your subject has lost a lot of detail.', '2004-02-10 20:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
