(575301, 57753, 16499, '<td valign="top">From critique club.<br/> <br/>The challenge conditions stated "...Using the kind of things you''d typically find in a garage..." where "a garage" would mean any kind of garage.<br/> <br/>I gave this image +7 for the colorful garage art - nice shot and a great eye!<br/> <br/>The discount was made for the lack of sharpness and non-leveled scene.</td>', 'From critique club. The challenge conditions stated "...Using the kind of things you''d typically find in a garage..." where "a garage" would mean any kind of garage. I gave this image +7 for the colorful garage art - nice shot and a great eye! The discount was made for the lack of sharpness and non-leveled scene.', '2004-02-11 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
