(575473, 58418, 16266, '<td valign="top">hey there.<br/> <br/>don''t let your low score get you down.  it is great to see strong art pieces in here, and i can see you thought lots about this and what you wanted to portray... even though i am not done thinking about it yet, or have gone it ''figuredout'' i think i like it.  but beware, that unless your image is explicitly what is in the subject, don''t expect too high of a mark.... but keep it up.... it is great to have artists here.</td>', 'hey there. don''t let your low score get you down.  it is great to see strong art pieces in here, and i can see you thought lots about this and what you wanted to portray... even though i am not done thinking about it yet, or have gone it ''figuredout'' i think i like it.  but beware, that unless your image is explicitly what is in the subject, don''t expect too high of a mark.... but keep it up.... it is great to have artists here.', '2004-02-11 01:01:32.000000', NULL, 0),
