(575490, 58520, 16499, '<td valign="top">Why isn''t this a winner??? I refuse to understand!!!<br/> <br/>It is art, found in garage, funny, symbolic and _very_ original! There is perfect amount of light and it is precisely distributed to draw attention, the point of interest is properly positoned with secondary detail (threads) following the right path of the sight, the sparkles off the baby-wrench give it personality and smile and reliable hands of the ''papa'' won''t let it fall... I also like the sepia look of it with color hints on the star bursts.</td>', 'Why isn''t this a winner??? I refuse to understand!!! It is art, found in garage, funny, symbolic and _very_ original! There is perfect amount of light and it is precisely distributed to draw attention, the point of interest is properly positoned with secondary detail (threads) following the right path of the sight, the sparkles off the baby-wrench give it personality and smile and reliable hands of the ''papa'' won''t let it fall... I also like the sepia look of it with color hints on the star bursts.', '2004-02-11 01:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
