(576479, 57504, 16106, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by drydoc:</b></div><hr/><i> Now THAT is a work of art!  Vintage or kit? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Classic 1930''s (2 or 3 I think ) Mercedes, before it became associated with Benz. Better view of the car here. <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/25970924" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/image/25970924</a> <br/>One of the most beautifull cars ever created IMO.</td>', 'Originally posted by drydoc: Now THAT is a work of art!  Vintage or kit?   Classic 1930''s (2 or 3 I think ) Mercedes, before it became associated with Benz. Better view of the car here. //www.pbase.com/image/25970924 One of the most beautifull cars ever created IMO.', '2004-02-11 12:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
