(577939, 58487, 12253, '<td valign="top">In response to your request for comments:<br/> <br/>It''s simple, but to me seems a bit 2-dimensional (perhaps if you shot it closer or maybe this one would have worked better in color).  The centered composition doesn''t work well for me because the rope is not symmetrical (in fact it looks a bit tilted/lopsided, and the centered composition highlights that.).  I have never tried a rope shot, so it''s harder for me to describe what would have worked better compositionally, but I have seen some that really had impact on me, so perhaps you can search for ones that strike you around here, and on PhotoPoints (where I think I''ve seen some really good ones).</td>', 'In response to your request for comments: It''s simple, but to me seems a bit 2-dimensional (perhaps if you shot it closer or maybe this one would have worked better in color).  The centered composition doesn''t work well for me because the rope is not symmetrical (in fact it looks a bit tilted/lopsided, and the centered composition highlights that.).  I have never tried a rope shot, so it''s harder for me to describe what would have worked better compositionally, but I have seen some that really had impact on me, so perhaps you can search for ones that strike you around here, and on PhotoPoints (where I think I''ve seen some really good ones).', '2004-02-12 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(578492, 58359, 6504, '<td valign="top">This should have won -- For the most creative of the bunch!</td>', 'This should have won -- For the most creative of the bunch!', '2004-02-12 20:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(578967, 58523, 3087, '<td valign="top">I didn''t look at the entries on this one so this is the first time I''ve seen any of them.<br/>Beautiful motion capture and I love that "texture" where there is an overlap of blades... I also love the almost geometric pattern of blades and gaps. <br/>Black and white works well, composition, with the hub forming a diagonal line across the lower part of the frame, is also strong.<br/>Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'I didn''t look at the entries on this one so this is the first time I''ve seen any of them.Beautiful motion capture and I love that "texture" where there is an overlap of blades... I also love the almost geometric pattern of blades and gaps. Black and white works well, composition, with the hub forming a diagonal line across the lower part of the frame, is also strong.Congrats on your ribbon!', '2004-02-13 05:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(578969, 58416, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, another wonderful ribbon winner. The colours and textures in the droplet are really appealing and the "tick" shaped composition works so well.</td>', 'Beautiful, another wonderful ribbon winner. The colours and textures in the droplet are really appealing and the "tick" shaped composition works so well.', '2004-02-13 05:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(578972, 57911, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like your lighting in this - it adds such a lot to the results. The deep shadows really emphasise that idea of a private domain, a deeply personal territory. The details, such as the cigarette, the neatly aligned beer bottles and the knick-knacks give me plenty to look at. This image really communicates...</td>', 'I really like your lighting in this - it adds such a lot to the results. The deep shadows really emphasise that idea of a private domain, a deeply personal territory. The details, such as the cigarette, the neatly aligned beer bottles and the knick-knacks give me plenty to look at. This image really communicates...', '2004-02-13 05:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(579333, 58350, 16163, '<td valign="top">Not bad effort. colour is lovely but the name spannerism would have been better.</td>', 'Not bad effort. colour is lovely but the name spannerism would have been better.', '2004-02-13 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(579425, 58416, 7369, '<td valign="top">Hi Scott,<br/> <br/>Sorry that I didn''t comment or vote but real life got in the way :). Nevertheless it is a great photo and fits the challenge wonderfully. Congratulations with your deserved second place.<br/> <br/>Danny<br/></td>', 'Hi Scott, Sorry that I didn''t comment or vote but real life got in the way :). Nevertheless it is a great photo and fits the challenge wonderfully. Congratulations with your deserved second place. Danny', '2004-02-13 17:24:55.000000', NULL, 0),
