(738926, 57675, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think this was intersting work, especially for a first-time effort at ''studio'' lighting Jon. I''d have filled it from the right a touch more, and probably have lost the rear-most pot, which was just over-egging the pudding a touch for my own taste. Gave it a 6 at the time though, but never commented.</td>', 'I think this was intersting work, especially for a first-time effort at ''studio'' lighting Jon. I''d have filled it from the right a touch more, and probably have lost the rear-most pot, which was just over-egging the pudding a touch for my own taste. Gave it a 6 at the time though, but never commented.', '2004-05-27 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(739422, 58467, 10778, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about it being too dark, I think I know what you were doing here.  I like it! Nice job from my viewpoint. Imagination is the key, those who don''t have it, never will.</td>', 'I don''t know about it being too dark, I think I know what you were doing here.  I like it! Nice job from my viewpoint. Imagination is the key, those who don''t have it, never will.', '2004-05-27 14:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(742776, 58381, 7322, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, I can see how this didn''t score higher. I love it''s simplicity. The texture and the quiet tones tell the story. Lovely. I would buy a print of this. I think my dad would love it. <br/> <br/>As for meeting the challenge, this challenge seems almost like it could have been an free study. One can find far more unlikely things in a garage than an old hat. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-30 17:28:44.</i></td>', 'Oh boy, I can see how this didn''t score higher. I love it''s simplicity. The texture and the quiet tones tell the story. Lovely. I would buy a print of this. I think my dad would love it.  As for meeting the challenge, this challenge seems almost like it could have been an free study. One can find far more unlikely things in a garage than an old hat. ', '2004-05-30 18:25:59.000000', '2004-05-30 18:28:44.000000', 0),
