(1356865, 58359, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT shot.  I am very strict about meeting the challenge, but I think you did.  You used humor to slam the challenge.  You pay your money to participate in challenges and they don''t realise, "I Don''t Have a Garage"!!  Sometimes when I''m having a bad day at work, I just think of this shot and I''m giggling!  Thanks, and great work!! :)</td>', 'This is a GREAT shot.  I am very strict about meeting the challenge, but I think you did.  You used humor to slam the challenge.  You pay your money to participate in challenges and they don''t realise, "I Don''t Have a Garage"!!  Sometimes when I''m having a bad day at work, I just think of this shot and I''m giggling!  Thanks, and great work!! :)', '2005-05-03 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
